<header><p class="st-kicker">city state · Central Asia and the Steppe</p><h1 class="st-title">Principality of Kesh</h1><p class="st-meta">500 CE – 740 CE (approx.) · capital Kesh</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">A Sogdian principality south of Samarkand, centred on the city later called Shahrisabz, the birthplace of Timur.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>Kesh lay on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kashkadarya">Qashqadarya River</a> in southern <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/principality-of-samarkand">Sogdiana</a>. It became one of the Sogdian principalities in the 6th century, under the overlordship of the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/western-turkic-khaganate">Western Turkic Khaganate</a>, and was ruled by local lords who issued their own coins.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>Like its neighbours, Kesh was a town of farmers, craftsmen and merchants governed by a local dynasty and nobility. Chinese sources call it Shi, and it traded through <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/samarkand">Samarkand</a> and over the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iron-gate-central-asia">Iron Gate</a> pass to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tokharistan">Tokharistan</a>. Very little detail survives about its rulers or institutions.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>Arab armies conquered Kesh during the campaigns of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/qutayba-ibn-muslim">Qutayba ibn Muslim</a> in the early 8th century, and it was absorbed into <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/umayyad-caliphate">Umayyad</a> and Abbasid <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/transoxiana">Transoxiana</a>. The city, renamed <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/shahrisabz">Shahrisabz</a>, later became the home town of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/timur">Timur</a>.</p><p class="st-conf">Few sources survive for this state; details are uncertain.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="city state, 500 CE – 740 CE (approx.)"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 82 V42 H32 V34 H40 V42 H46 V34 H54 V42 H60 V34 H68 V42 H76 V82 Z"/><path d="M44 82 V66 Q50 58 56 66 V82"/><path d="M34 54 H40 M60 54 H66"/></svg><p class="st-emblem-type">city state</p><p class="st-emblem-region